<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">Philippi</book>
  <para style="h">Philippi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Philippi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philippi</para>
  <para style="mt">Philippi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul leh Timothi Jesu Khrist suohten, Philippi khuo a um Khrist Jesu a misiengthoute zousie kungah leh hattuom lamkaite leh upate kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I Pa uh Pasian leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist kunga kipat hepina leh lungmuonna na kung uah um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Noute ka hing geeldoh chintengin ka Pasian kungah kipahthu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noute zousie a dinga lungnop taha hing ngetpieha thu ka nget chintengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni masa pen akipat in tu dongin, khantanhoi a na hing kipawlkhawmpina zieh un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama noute sunga nasep hoi panpain Jesu Khrist ni tandongin abawl muolsuo ngei ding chi dettah in ka gingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noute zousie tungtang thu a tambang ngaituona ka nei khu adih mawng ahi; noute lungtanga ka hing vom zieh a, ka kolbuna leh khantanhoi dihna thu leh namdetna thu a hepina ka tanpite na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu Khrist lainatna in noute na unpi un ka hing ngai mama hi chi, Pasian ahing theipipa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh theina leh theikah theina lam a noute itna akhan semsem theina dingin tami ka ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachia sil hoipente na hing theichien ua, Khrist ni donga atahtah siengthou leh mawna bei na hing hi theina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasian thupina ding leh phatna dingin, Jesu Khrist a um dihtatna gate in dim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh unaute aw, ka tunga sil tungte pen khantanhoi dalzah semna dinga hing tung ahi chi na thei uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kaisar innpi veng galkapte zousie leh mundang a mi zousie kungah Khrist a ka kolbuna khu akichienta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa a unau tamtahin ka kolbute zieh a Mangpa a muonna nei in Pasian thu zaulou a gen dingin ahangsan deu deu ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawlkhatte’n thangsietna leh ki elna ziehin Khrist thu agen uhi, tualeh pawlkhatte’n lungsim hoina toh agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amasa pawl in ginumna toh hilou in amauh angsung khuolna toh Khrist thu agen ua, ka kolbuna ban ah gentheina abelap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh anukhia pawl in pen, khantanhoi gupna zieh a thuoh ka hi chi thei in itna ziehin Khrist thu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bang akhawh diei? Bawlthu hiin, thutah hitaleh, banglam pou ah Khrist thu akigen nah pouleh, ka kipah a, ahi ka kipah zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen tami na thumna u’leh Jesu Khrist Hagau panpina zal in ka tunga sil tungte ka hundamna ahing suoh ding ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka lam etna leh ka kinepna mama dungzuiin, bangma ah zumsahin ka um sih dinga, hinanleh hangsantah a ka gen ngitngetsa bangin, tuin zong hinna ahiei, shina ahiei, ka tahsa ah, Khrist khu suhthupi in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen keidingin hin Khrist ahia, shi zong metna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh tahsa a hin khu ka tan hi henlen, tua khu ka sepgim ga hita leh bangpen ahiei ka tel zawh ding ka thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen sil ni tetuo kaal ah, chiding zawsang theilouin ka um a, pawtdoha Khrist toh umkhawm ding ka lunggul hi; tua pen ahoizaw tham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahivang in tahsa a um khu noute ziehin apoimaw zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tami gindetna nei in, na ginna uh khanletna ding leh na ginna ua, na kipahna dingun, noute zousie toh ka umkhawm nalai ding chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na kung ua ka hing haw kiana zieh a, Kei dinga Khrist Jesu a na kipahna uh atam sem theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na umdan u’leh Khrist khantanhoi kituohsah phot un; hing pei a noute hing mu a, ahisihleh ka umlou a zong, hagau khat a na dinkip dan u’leh, lungsim khat nei a, khantanhoi thuginna a na pankhawm dan uh, na tanchin uh ka zah theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh bangma pou ah na melmate uh suhzau in um sih un; tuakhu ama ua dinga manthaina chiemtena kichientah ahi a, hinanleh noute a dinga Pasian akipata hundamna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aziehpen Khrist zieha nouten Ama na gintat guoh uh hilou a, Ama vanga thuoh zong na thuoh ding uh ahi chi phal na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kidouna Keima a um na musa bang u’leh tu a keima a um nalai na zah bang uh nouten zong na nei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin Khrist a kihenepna bang, itna a lungmuonna bang, Hagau a kipawlkhawmna bang, tualeh kilainatna leh ki khotuona bang aum leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungsim kibanga um in, itna kibang neiin, tup kibang leh lungsim khat puo a umin ka kipahna subukim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Angsung khuolna ahisihleh kipilsahna ahiei in bangma bawlsih unlen, hinanleh michinin lungsim a kingaingiem tahin, mi dangte ama sanga hoizaw in ngaituo heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lah ua mi koipou in ama hoina ding guoh en sih henlen, midangte hoina ding zong en uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a zong um tam lungsim khu noute ah zong um heh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama Pasian banga um hinapi, Pasian toh kibanga um khu sil khiehla huoi in angaituo sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Ama hing kikoi ngiemin, suoh bangin ahing um a, mihing bangin ahing pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh mihing lim leh mel bang hing puoin, ahing kingaingiem a, shi tandongin thu amanga, Kross ah shina nangawn ahing thuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian in zong Ama nasatahin atawi sangta a, min zousie lah a min tungnung pen apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachia Jesu min a, mizousie vantung sil um, leitunga sil umte leh lei nuoia sil um chintengte akhupdin ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lei chintengin, Jesu Khrist khu Pa Pasian thupina dinga Mangpa ahi chi aphuong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka ittahte aw, ka um pet chieng guoh hilouin, tua ka umlou lai a zong thu na man zel mabangun, zau leh chitun pumin na hundamna chiet uh semkhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama deilam bawl dinga noute hing utsahpa leh hing semsahpa khu Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sil zousie phunlou leh niel louin bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tulai khang gilou leh sildihlou bawlte lah a leitunga vahte banga na taannate lah ua gensiet bei leh poikhoilou Pasian tate na hitheina dingun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinna thu tudet un, Khrist ni hing tun chienga ken amawhna’n ka tai sih a, amawhna’n ka semgim sih chia ka kipah theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi, na ginna kithoina sillat u’leh na nasepna tung uah dawn sillatte banga sunbuoh a um hinanleng ka kipah a, noute zousie toh ka lungnuom khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tamte zieh main noute zong kipah unlen, kei toh zong lungnuom khawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Timothi na kung ua hing sawl pai dingin Mangpa Jesu ah ka kinem hi, na tanchin uh ka thei chieng a kei zong lungmuong tah a ka um theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen noute hoina ding ngaituo tahtah lungsim kibahpi midang ka nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi zousiein Jesu Khrist silte suilou in, ama uh angsung ding maimai asui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh ama pen tapain pa toh asepkhawm bangin, khantanhoi nasepna ah ahing panpi chi theichienna ama ah na nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin bangchibanga um ding ka hiei chi ka theichiengin ama hing sawl pai ding ka kinem hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh keima ngel zong hing pei pai ding in, Mangpa ah ka kigingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh ka unau leh ka naseppi leh ka galkappi, na sawltah u’leh ka tahsapna hing kithuopipa Epaphroditus na kung ua hing sawl poimaw kasa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aman noute na bawn un ahing ngaina mama a, achinat thu na zah zieh un alunggim mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama shi dihtahin achina ngaingut a, hinanleh Pasian in ama akhotuo a, ahi, amatung guoh hilou in Kei zong ahing khotuo hi; tuahisihleh kei a dingin lunggim na tungah lunggimna dang aban ban in aum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin ama khawhsatah a hing sawl ka kithalawp dieh hi; ama na mu kia chieng ua na kipah ua, tualeh kei lunggim na zong aphatdawm deu na ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaziehin kipahtahin, Mangpa ah ama na pom unlen, ama bang mite zatat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aziehpen, nouten kei dinga na hing seppiehna uh kimloute asuhbuchingna dingin Khrist nasepna ah aman ahinna zong khawhsa lou in ana shi dihtah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atawppen in ka unaute aw, Mangpa ah nuom un, na kung ua angaima gelkia, kei a dingin chimtahhuoi ahi sih hi. Nou dingin ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Uite lah ah kivengun, sil gilou bawlte lah ah kiveng unlen, tahsa atsegawpte lah ah kiveng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eite pen, Hagau a Pasian bie teptante ihi ua, tualeh Khrist Jesu ah i kipah mama ua, tahsa ah vang suon ding inei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tahsa lam a suon ding chileng ken suon ding ka neizaw khamaw sih ding hi. Mi koi ahieiin tahsa a suon ding nei a akithei leh ken ka nei sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni giet ni a teptan, Israel mi, Benjamin nam; Hebrute laha Hebru dihtah, dan theina lam a Pharisai mi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Phattuomngaina lam ah, hattuomte bawlsepa ka na hi a, dan a dihtatna lam ah, genbanglou ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh kei a dinga metna zousie, Khrist ziehin supna in ka simta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh adihtah in, Khrist Jesu ka Mangpa theina hoitah ziehin, sil zousie supnain ka sim a, Ama ziehin sil zousie ka tanta a, tualeh tuate Khrist ka nei theina dingin buathah kikholkhawm bang giapin ka ngaisut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dan a kipat a keima dihtatna nei hiloua, Khrist ginna zieh a um, ginna a Pasian a dihtatna khu nei a Ama-a mu a ka um theina dingin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachia Ama leh athawkiana silbawltheina ka thei theina dingin, athuohgimna kikoppiin, ashina ah ama bah ka ut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangchi ahiei beeha mishi lah akipat a thawkiana ka tan theikhah leh kachi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Atang zouta ka hi sih a, abukimzouta zong ka hisih hi, hinanleh Khrist Jesu in kei ahing tuhdet bangin tuami ma ka tuhdet theina dingin ka del a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unaute aw, kei pen neizouta in ka kingaituo sih a, hinanleh tam sil khat ka bawl hi; nualam a sil umte manghil in, mailam a sil umte ka del hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kipahman sang dingin Pasian in vanlam hatnain Khrist ah kei ahing han a, tua kipahman mu tumin phahtawpna mun ka del a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin ei apiching tengin tambang lungsim nei chiet vai, tualeh sil dang khat a ngaituona tuom na nei u’leh, tuomi nangawn zong Pasian in noute ahing theisah nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahivang in itunna chieng chieng ah, tua dan ma zuiin gamta vai in, lungsim kibangin um vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Unaute aw, ka umdan entonte hi chiet unlen, tuabanga umte etton dinga na hing neite uh chiemte un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen mi tampi a umta ua, amauh umdan, ka hinghil munta hi, tuin zong hitui luongpum in, ka hing hil hi, amaute Khrist Kross melmate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Atawpna uh khu sietna ahi a, apasien uh khu agilpi uh ahi a, tualeh athupina u’zong azumna uh ahi. Alungsimte un leitung silte angaituo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eite khuoletui hina pen vangam ah ahia, tuana kipat in Mangpa Jesu Khrist hundampa kinem tah in ingah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aman sil zousie Ama thu thua aumsah theina nasep dan dungzuiin itahsa thulimlou khu Ama tahsa thupitah batpi in ahing bawlthapieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka unau it leh ngaite aw, ka kipahna leh ka manglukhuhte, tuachi’n ka itte aw, Mangpa ah dingdet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa a lungsim munkhat paw dingin Euodia ka ngen a, Sintike ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh ka hahkol puohpi muonhuoi nang zong ka hing ngen ahi, khantanhoi nna ka seppi tam numeite leh Klemen zong, tualeh hinna laibu a min tuong, ka naseppi dangte panpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa ah kipah ngitnget un, ka chi kia ding kipah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lungnemna uh mi zousie thei hi heh, Mangpa anai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangma ah Patau sih unlen, hinanleh sil bangkim ah thumna leh ngetnain kipahthugenna toh, na sil deite uh Pasian kungah theisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n theisiem guollou Pasian lungmuonnain, Khrist ziehin na lungtangte u’leh na lungsimte uh ahing venpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atawppen in unaute aw, thutah pouma, azatat huoi pouma, sil dih pouma, sil siengthou pouma, sil deihuoi pouma, sil hoi a kigen pouma, hoina bang a uma, pahtawitham ching bang aum leh tam silte ngaituo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima apat a na zilsa uh, na tansa uh, na zahsa uh leh na musa uh, silte bawl un, tuachi’n lungmuonna Pasian in ahing umpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nouten kei na hing awlmawna uh atawplam a na hing latsahkia zieh un, Mangpa ah nahpitahin ka kipah hi. Kei na hing awlmaw mama ua hinanleh na latsahna dinguh hunlemtaang na mu sih ua ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tahsap zieh a tam thu ka gen ahi sih, bangchibangin um nanleng lungkim dan ka theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tasam tah a umdan ka thei a, kiningching taha umdan zong ka thei hi. Munchin leh silzousie ah gilva leh gilkiel a um theina leh hausa tah leh tasam a um dan ka zilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima hing hatsahpa Khrist ziehin sil zousie ka bawl thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahivang in ka mangbatna a na hing thuohpi zieh un na bawl hoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nou Philippimiten zong na thei uhi, khantanhoi kipat chiila, Masidonia gam a kipat, ka kipat doh lai in, noute chilou hattuom dang koima’n pieh leh lah lam thu ah ahing panpi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thessalonika khuo a ka um lai nangawn in, ka tahsap chiengin nouten panpina nahing hah ua, na hing hahkia zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Silpieh ka dei man ahi sih a, noute dinga gapung sui ka hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sil zousie kiningching tahin ka nei a, ka hau hi, noute a kipat a hing kihah silte, gimnam tui kithoina, Pasian pomtah leh lungkim huoi khu Epaphroditus khuta kipat in ka muta a, ka kiningchingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh ka Pasian in ahausatna thupi dungzui in, na tahsapna zousie uh ahing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin i Pasian leh Pa kungah kumtawn kumtawnin thupina umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a misiengthou zousie hing na nousiet pieh un. Ka kunga um unauten, ahing nousiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Misiengthou zousie’n adiehin Kaisar innsung miten ahing nousiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist hepina na unpi ua tung ah umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
